@startuml
!pragma theme plain
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam activityShape roundBox
skinparam padding 5
skinparam arrowColor #444444
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #EEEEEE
  BorderColor #444444
}
title OpenCode Entrepreneur-MCP Workflow — Aligned with PROMPT-V1.0.0

|Orchestrator|
start

:Phase 0: Initialize & Synthesise Team;
repeat
  :Create repository structure and pnpm project;
  :Run Team Architect:
  - Analyse user project goal (domain, stack, scale, compliance)
  - Generate skills/roles-manifest.json (dynamic roles)
  - Generate skills/sod-matrix.md (SoD rules per tower)
  - Generate skills/tui-modules.md (5 question modules)
  - Generate skills/role-*.md (one per synthesised role);
  :Verify pnpm and local tooling;
  :Instantiate in‑memory agents per role;

  if (Gate: all generated files valid and roles have non‑empty SoD rules?) then (Yes)
    break
  else (No)
    :Re‑run synthesis;
  endif
repeat while (true) is (true)

:Phase 1: TUI‑driven Requirements Clarification;
repeat
  :TUI session:
  - Present modules from tui-modules.md (Requirements, Error/Validation, Infrastructure & SLO, Security, GDPR/SOC2)
  - Capture raw answers into docs/00_requirements/ssot_raw_answers.json
  - Product & Strategy roles refine into PRD/SRS drafts
  - Security & Compliance roles write module questions
  - Orchestrator logs conflicts and updates SSOT;
  if (SSOT stable AND (user endorsed OR no missing pieces)?) then (Yes)
    break
  else (No)
    :Address conflicts / missing items;
    :Update SSOT;
  endif
repeat while (true) is (true)

:Phase 2: Create Specification & Design Documents;
repeat
  :Generate full docs/ tree (00_requirements, 01_architecture, 02_setup, 03_testing, 04_operations, 05_security_compliance, 06_user_reference) with all required files;
  :Assign domain roles to write each document (PM, Architects, QA, DevOps, Sec, Docs);
  :Verify all docs exist with meaningful content and each requirement is traceable to at least one document;
  if (Gate: all required docs generated and traceable?) then (Yes)
    break
  else (No)
    :Fix documents / address gaps;
  endif
repeat while (true) is (true)

:Phase 3: Code the Project;
repeat
  :Domain engineering roles (Full‑Stack, Frontend, Backend, etc.) write code following design and TUI transcripts;
  :Compile/build and run unit tests;
  :Orchestrator enforces SoD – blocks violations, logs them, and re‑routes to correct role;
  if (Gate: build succeeds, all tests pass, and no SoD violations?) then (Yes)
    break
  else (No)
    :Fix code or re‑assign to correct role;
  endif
repeat while (true) is (true)

:Phase 4: Security Checking;
repeat
  :Run local tool adapters: audit.mjs, security-scan.mjs, secret-scan.mjs, license-check.mjs;
  :Generate docs/05_security_compliance/vulnerability-report.md;
  :Update docs/05_security_compliance/security-hardening.md with mitigations;
  if (Gate: critical/high vulnerabilities fixed or accepted with risk assessment?) then (Yes)
    break
  else (No)
    :Remediate or accept risk with justification;
  endif
repeat while (true) is (true)

:Phase 5: Compliance Checking;
repeat
  :Run GDPR & SOC2 checklists;
  :Generate SBOM (CycloneDX XML and Markdown) via sbom.mjs;
  :Update docs/05_security_compliance/:
  - compliance-checklist.md
  - gdpr-compliance.md
  - soc2-compliance.md
  - sbom/bom.xml
  - sbom/sbom.md;
  if (Gate: mandatory compliance requirements satisfied or remediation plan approved?) then (Yes)
    break
  else (No)
    :Plan remediation;
  endif
repeat while (true) is (true)

:Phase 6: Finalize Spec/Design & Requirements Traceability Matrix;
repeat
  :Finalise all Specification & Design docs based on security/compliance findings;
  :Write docs/00_requirements/requirements-traceability-matrix.md tracing each requirement to architecture, code, tests, security, compliance;
  if (Gate: traceability covers 100% of requirements and all docs finalised?) then (Yes)
    break
  else (No)
    :Update traceability / finalise docs;
  endif
repeat while (true) is (true)

:Phase 7: Finalize Reports & Summaries;
repeat
  :Generate docs/table-of-content-tree.md;
  :Create versioned reports under docs/07_reports/:
  - final-summary-v<n>.md & .json
  - orchestration-summary-v<n>.md
  - workflow-summary-v<n>.md
  - operations-summary-v<n>.md
  (increment version if file exists);
  if (Gate: all reports complete and TOC links all docs?) then (Yes)
    break
  else (No)
    :Regenerate reports;
  endif
repeat while (true) is (true)

:All phases complete — Definition of Done;
:Full MCP structure exists;
:Dynamic roles synthesised;
:TUI functional;
:All gates enforced;
:SoD violations logged;
:Reports versioned;
stop

@enduml